{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36853","headline":"送姚安之赴任秋浦 · 罗隐","name":"送姚安之赴任秋浦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官罢春坊地象雷，片帆高指贵池开。\n五侯水暖鱼鳞去，九子山晴雁叙来。\n江夏黄童徒逞辩，广都庞令恐非才。\n到头称意须年少，赢得时光向酒杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}